{
  "id": "commerce-selection-real-heldout-v2",
  "split": "heldout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "official-fresh-v2",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "我在上海人民广场。找附近营业中的麦当劳，读最近一家菜单，我想看看美式但先不买。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.search_stores",
              "commerce.menu"
            ],
            "no_checkout": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "选菜单里的麦咖啡美式，一杯。先看具体详情，再按官方默认做报价；冷热杯型以这个实际商品为准，不提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "proposed"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "needs_selection",
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_matches_detail": true,
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "就刚才查到的那款，一杯默认，带走，只更新预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "proposed"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_matches_detail": true,
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "我改在店里喝了，商品和份数不要变，不下单。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "proposed"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_matches_detail": true,
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "堂食",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "算了取消这份还没提交的预览，不改我的训练餐食。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}